<h3>Helpful to have ready</h3><ul class="plain-list"><li>Your declarations page</li><li>The carrier’s full estimate (PDF)</li><li>Letters or emails from the carrier</li><li>Photos and any contractor estimates</li></ul></div>
<div class="rv"><form class="lead" action="/api/contact.php" method="post" data-lead novalidate>
<p class="lead-h">Tell us about your claim</p><p class="lead-sub">Free review, no obligation. We usually reply within one business day.</p>
<div class="lead-grid">
<div><label for="f-name">Full name *</label><input id="f-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required></div>
<div><label for="f-phone">Phone *</label><input id="f-phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" required></div>
<div class="full"><label for="f-email">Email *</label><input id="f-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></div>
<div><label for="f-role">I am a…</label><select id="f-role" name="role"><option>Homeowner</option><option>Condo owner</option><option>Commercial owner</option><option>Property manager / HOA</option><option>Contractor</option><option>Attorney</option><option>Public adjuster</option><option>Other</option></select></div>
<div><label for="f-loss">Type of loss</label><select id="f-loss" name="loss"><option>Wind</option><option>Snow load / ice dam</option><option>Frozen pipe / water</option><option>Fire / smoke / wildfire</option><option>Earthquake (with coverage)</option><option>Roof damage</option><option>Other</option></select></div>
<div><label for="f-city">Property location</label><select id="f-city" name="city"><option>Anchorage</option><option>Eagle River &amp; Chugiak</option><option>Wasilla</option><option>Palmer</option><option>Fairbanks</option><option>Juneau</option><option>Ketchikan</option><option>Sitka</option><option>Kenai &amp; Soldotna</option><option>Homer</option><option>Kodiak</option><option>Valdez</option><option>Elsewhere in Alaska</option><option>Off the road system</option></select></div>
<div><label for="f-amt">Approx. amount in dispute</label><select id="f-amt" name="amount"><option>Not sure</option><option>Under $10,000</option><option>$10,000–$25,000</option><option>$25,000–$75,000</option><option>$75,000–$250,000</option><option>Over $250,000</option></select></div>
<div class="full"><label for="f-car">Insurance company (optional)</label><input id="f-car" name="carrier"></div>
<div class="full"><label for="f-det">What happened, and where does the claim stand?</label><textarea id="f-det" name="details" rows="4" placeholder="Date of loss, what the carrier has paid or offered, and what you think was missed."></textarea></div>
<div class="full hp" aria-hidden="true"><label for="f-web">Website</label><input id="f-web" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></div>
<input type="hidden" name="page" value="/contact-an-appraiser/">
<div class="full"><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" value="1" required> <span>I agree to be contacted about my claim by phone, text or email. This doesn’t create a client relationship. See the <a href="/privacy-and-data/">privacy page</a>.</span></label></div>
<div class="full"><button class="btn gold block" type="submit">Send my claim details <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button></div>
</div>
<div class="form-msg" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
</form></div></div></section>
